         Our Mission It is the Office of the City Clerk’s mission to be a primary provider of information and quality services to the community while performing a myriad of tasks to achieve established goals and comply with state and local statutes. Hours of Operation Monday: 8:30AM - 4:30PM Tuesday:  8:30AM - 7:00PM   Wednesday:   8:30AM - 4:30PM     Thursday:  8:30AM - 4:30PM   Friday:  8:30AM - 1:30PM   Weekends: Closed Public meetings & Calendar This office accepts the required postings for all public meetings and maintains the public meetings calendar. Annual Census, Federal & Local Elections The department conducts the Annual Census and maintains the voter lists, and also conducts all Federal, State and Local elections. Available Records Records found in this office are: Annual Reports Birth Certificates Death Certificates Elections Records Lists of former elected and or appointed officers Marriage Licenses Meeting Records Special Reports to City Meeting Zoning Decisions Type of Permits & Licenses Issued This office issues a number of licenses such as: DBA Certificates Dog licenses Marriage licenses Raffles and bazaar permits 
     

 
